00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:16.300
recámaras,

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:17.380
con roof garden privado,

00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:18.440
y la mejor vista

00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:18.940
al mar.

00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:20.180
Imagina una pausa en

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:20.780
la alberca,

00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:21.620
juegos con tus amigos

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:22.340
en la cancha de

00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:22.940
pickleball,

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:24.200
tardes de asador,

00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:25.060
o cenas con tus

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:25.860
seres queridos en las

00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:26.280
amenidades,

00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:26.900
o en tu roof

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:27.460
privado.

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:28.860
Cuida tu liquidez con

00:00:28.860 --> 00:00:29.740
pagos flexibles:

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:30.660
diez por ciento de

00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:31.160
enganche,

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:32.060
diez por ciento en

00:00:32.060 --> 00:00:33.200
veinte mensualidades, y

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:34.420
ochenta por ciento contra

00:00:34.420 --> 00:00:35.660
entrega, a mediados del

00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:36.460
dos mil veintiocho.

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:38.162
Genera plusvalía anual,

00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:39.160
más flujos mensuales con

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:40.380
renta de estancia corta.

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:41.740
Vive la experiencia de

00:00:41.740 --> 00:00:42.580
contar con una smart

00:00:42.580 --> 00:00:43.240
home, y

00:00:43.240 --> 00:00:44.380
controlar las luces,

00:00:44.480 --> 00:00:44.880
minisplit

00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:46.120
y cerradura digital desde

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:46.880
tu celular.

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:48.000
Si apartas tu casa

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:48.660
este mes,

00:00:48.880 --> 00:00:49.680
llévate la cocina,

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:50.420
cuartos,

00:00:50.520 --> 00:00:51.080
baños y

00:00:51.080 --> 00:00:51.940
roof con equipamiento

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:52.620
incluido,

00:00:52.740 --> 00:00:53.200
¡ahorrando hasta

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:54.040
cuatrocientos cincuenta

00:00:54.040 --> 00:00:54.720
mil pesos!

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:55.920
Haz clic en el

00:00:55.920 --> 00:00:56.620
